<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>找回密码｜书库</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css?v=20261031a">
  <script src="/js/site.js?v=20261031a" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="auth-body">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
  <header class="auth-header"><a class="site-name" href="/">书库</a><a href="/">返回书库</a></header>
  <main class="auth-page" id="main-content">
    <p class="page-eyebrow">账号帮助</p>
    <h1>找回密码</h1>
    <p class="hint">输入注册邮箱，我们会发送重置链接。链接 1 小时内有效，请同时检查垃圾邮件。</p>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="auth-alert auth-alert-error" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
    <% if (notice) { %><div class="auth-alert auth-alert-ok" role="status"><%= notice %></div><% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/forgot-password" autocomplete="on" data-loading="正在发送…">
      <label for="forgot-email">注册邮箱</label>
      <input id="forgot-email" type="email" name="email" required maxlength="255" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" autofocus>
      <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">发送重置链接</button>
    </form>
    <div class="auth-links"><a href="/login">想起密码？返回登录</a></div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
